1
00:00:12,336 --> 00:00:17,636
Bonjour ! C'est combien, les pommes ?
Hello! How much are the apples?

2
00:00:17,736 --> 00:00:20,564
Deux euros le kilo.
Two euros a kilo.

3
00:00:20,664 --> 00:00:23,180
Et les fraises ?
And the strawberries?

4
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,348
Quatre euros la barquette.
Four euros a punnet.

5
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:31,940
Je prends deux kilos de pommes et une barquette de fraises, s'il vous plaît.
I'll take two kilos of apples and a punnet of strawberries, please.

6
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:36,332
Très bien. Ça fait huit euros.
Very good. That comes to eight euros.

7
00:00:36,432 --> 00:00:39,188
Voilà dix euros.
Here's ten euros.

8
00:00:39,288 --> 00:00:44,612
Merci. Et voilà votre monnaie : deux euros.
Thank you. And here's your change: two euros.

9
00:00:44,712 --> 00:00:48,020
Merci, bonne journée !
Thanks, have a nice day!

10
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:50,492
Vous aussi !
You too!
